wed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§4.4, pp. 90–91; scans 98–99"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}nullable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\nN_0^G\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad N_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq N_n^G\\cup\\{A\\in V:\\exists\\alpha\\in(N_n^G)^*\\;(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}nullable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\nN_0^G\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad N_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq N_n^G\\cup\\{A\\in V:\\exists\\alpha\\in(N_n^G)^*\\;(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}nullable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nullable}(G)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}N_n^G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}nullable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nullable}(G)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}N_n^G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空右部属于任意集合的星，因此空产生式在第一阶段进入；只由已可空变量组成的右部在下一阶段加入。每阶段都是 V 的子集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-cfg-structure]]，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}nullable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\nN_0^G\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad N_{n+1}^G\\coloneqq N_n^G\\cup\\{A\\in V:\\exists\\alpha\\in(N_n^G)^*\\;(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}nullable\\text{-}variables}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nullable}(G)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}N_n^G","display":true}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"3b0149ed221ad66a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$。可空集见 [[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]，文法语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables|可空非终结符的有限不动点]]"},{"id":"a01cd76e5cbb0051","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$A\\in V$。三个阶段序列和推导语言见 [[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-generating-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-reachable-variables]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。"}],"outgoing":["33052f3722